{"version":1,"content":"<p>為了在AI時代調整員工隊伍，進一步削減成本，微軟將向約6萬名員工提供自願離職補償方案。微軟發言人表示，美國、加拿大、印度和英國部分團隊中副總裁及以下級別的員工將符合條件。一些業務部門員工不在計劃之列，包括一些從事數據中心、銷售和營銷工作的人員。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583946.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T17:40:13.558240+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T17:34:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T17:38:09.124967+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T17:38:09.124967+00:00","content_hash":"c247ab7c9386662b956d784431f2ec6ec886cd9b072fde6a8189153a41634320","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}